[
  {
    "id": 2002003020010,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "プロデューサー。今日はお休みなのに\r\nレッスンに付き合っていただいて、ありがとうございました",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "charType": "idols",
    "charId": "1030020010",
    "charPosition": {
      "x": 568,
      "y": 640,
      "order": 0
    },
    "bg": "00014",
    "bgm": "002",
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "from",
      "alpha": 0,
      "time": 100
    },
    "voice": "produce_events/200200302/2002003020010"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "いや、気にするな\r\n俺も見させてもらえて良かったよ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2002003020020,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "プロデューサー、この後予定はありますか？",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200200302/2002003020020"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "いや、もう帰ろうと思ってたところだ\r\n灯織は違うのか？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2002003020030,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "少し買い物をしてから帰ろうと思っていたんです\r\n……プロデューサーも、良かったら一緒に行きませんか？",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200200302/2002003020030"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "買い物か……\r\n今日のうちに買い込んでおきたかったし、俺も一緒に行くよ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "off",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textFrame": "off",
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "to",
      "alpha": 0,
      "time": 100
    }
  },
  {
    "bg": "00028",
    "waitType": "effect",
    "bgEffect": "fade"
  },
  {
    "se": "0120",
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 3000
  },
  {
    "charAnim1": "wait",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "charType": "idols",
    "charId": "1030020010",
    "charPosition": {
      "x": 568,
      "y": 640,
      "order": 0
    },
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "from",
      "alpha": 0,
      "time": 100
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 2002003020040,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "……そういえばプロデューサー\r\n今日は私服なんですね",
    "charAnim1": "surp1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200200302/2002003020040"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……もしかして、まだ休日に呼んだことを気にしてるのか？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "さっきも言ったけど、気を遣わなくても大丈夫だぞ\r\n家にいても、どうせ寝てるだけだしな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2002003020050,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "そう言っていただけると……\r\n……お休みの日、いつも寝てるだけなんですか？",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200200302/2002003020050"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "う……ま、まぁな\r\n良くないと思うんだけど、どうしてもな……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2002003020060,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "……別に\r\nお説教をしたかったわけではありません",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "face_anger",
    "charAnim3": "no",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy",
    "charAnim3Loop": false,
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200200302/2002003020060"
  },
  {
    "id": 2002003020070,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "ただプロデューサーも、プロデューサーじゃない時間が\r\nあるんだなって思って……",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200200302/2002003020070"
  },
  {
    "id": 2002003020080,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "休めてるなら、良かったです……",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200200302/2002003020080"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "え？\r\n今、何か言ったか？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2002003020090,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "いえ、何でもありません\r\nそれより、もう着きましたよ",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200200302/2002003020090"
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "off",
    "effectLabel": "black",
    "effectTarget": {
      "type": "rect",
      "width": 1136,
