    },
    "waitType": "effect"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ふぅ……セールだったとはいえ、\r\nちょっと買いすぎたな……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2002003020100,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "でもそれ、ほとんど冷凍食品ですよね？\r\n栄養バランスが偏りますよ",
    "charAnim1": "anger1",
    "charAnim2": "face_anger",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200200302/2002003020100"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "う……\r\n灯織は、野菜たっぷりだ……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2002003020110,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "はい\r\nお肉は家にあるので、今日はシチューでも作ります",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charAnim3": "yes",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charAnim3Loop": false,
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200200302/2002003020110"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そういえば、灯織は料理が得意だもんな……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2002003020120,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "得意というか……\r\n昔から作っているので慣れているだけです",
    "charAnim1": "surp1",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200200302/2002003020120"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "いや、それでもすごいぞ\r\n俺なんて、好きなものも自分で作れないし……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2002003020130,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "そうなんですか",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200200302/2002003020130"
  },
  {
    "id": 2002003020140,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "……あの\r\nプロデューサーの好きなものって何ですか？",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "l",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200200302/2002003020140"
  },
  {
    "select": "揚げ物だよ",
    "nextLabel": "1"
  },
  {
    "select": "煮物が好きだな",
    "nextLabel": "2"
  },
  {
    "textCtrl": "cm",
    "select": "卵焼きかな",
    "nextLabel": "3"
  },
  {
    "id": 2002003020150,
    "label": "1",
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "油っこいのが好きなんですね\r\n食べ過ぎると、太っちゃいますよ",
    "charAnim1": "anger2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200200302/2002003020150"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "まぁ、確かにそうなんだが……\r\nでも、美味しいじゃないか",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2002003020160,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "ふふ、子どもみたい\r\n……あ、悪い意味じゃないですよ",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200200302/2002003020160"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そ、そうか……？\r\nそれなら良いんだが……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2002003020170,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "確かに唐揚げとか美味しいですよね\r\nでも、揚げ物は私もあまり作ったことないです",
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200200302/2002003020170"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "へぇ\r\nやっぱり、用意が面倒だからか？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2002003020180,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "そういうわけではないんですけど……\r\n今まで機会がなかったので",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200200302/2002003020180"
  },
  {
    "id": 2002003020190,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "でも、せっかくなので\r\n今度、ちょっと挑戦してみます",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200200302/2002003020190"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ああ、それはいいな！\r\n揚げ物にするとなんでも美味しいからな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2002003020200,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "……ふふ\r\n本当にお好きなんですね",
    "charAnim1": "smile1",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "nextLabel": "end",
    "voice": "produce_events/200200302/2002003020200"
  },
  {
    "id": 2002003020210,
    "label": "2",
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "煮物……ですか？\r\nちょっと意外です",
    "charAnim1": "surp1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200200302/2002003020210"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そうか？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2002003020220,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "男の人は、ステーキとか\r\nお肉が好きなんだと思ってました",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200200302/2002003020220"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "それもいいんだけど……\r\n煮物の懐かしい味が、たまに恋しくなるんだ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2002003020230,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "懐かしい……\r\nちょっとわかる気がします",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200200302/2002003020230"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "俺は特にこだわったりはしないから\r\n煮てしまえば、なんでもいいとは思うんだけどな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2002003020240,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "……プロデューサー\r\n『なんでもいい』は作ってくれる人に失礼ですよ",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_anger",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200200302/2002003020240"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "い、いや、自分で作るならの話だぞ\r\n作ってもらったものに、そんなこと言わないよ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2002003020250,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "あ……そうですよね\r\nす、すみません……てっきり私が……",
    "charAnim1": "sad3",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200200302/2002003020250"
  },
  {
    "id": 2002003020260,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "……い、いえ、なんでもありません！",
    "charAnim1": "anger1",
    "charAnim2": "face_shy",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "nextLabel": "end",
    "voice": "produce_events/200200302/2002003020260"
  },
  {
    "id": 2002003020270,
    "label": "3",
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "……自分で作れないんですか？",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_anger",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200200302/2002003020270"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "いや、卵焼きは結構難しいんだぞ！\r\nいつも巻くのを失敗するんだ……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2002003020280,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "そうですか……",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200200302/2002003020280"
  },
  {
    "id": 2002003020290,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "私は小学生の時から作っていたので……\r\n慣れてない人には、難しいものなんですね",
    "charAnim1": "surp1",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200200302/2002003020290"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "へぇ……\r\n灯織は、そんな昔から料理をしていたんだな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2002003020300,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "はい\r\n少しずつ、親の家事を手伝うようになって……",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charAnim3": "yes",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charAnim3Loop": false,
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200200302/2002003020300"
  },
  {
    "id": 2002003020310,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "そういえば私が初めて作ったのも卵焼きでした\r\n父が美味しいと言ってくれたので、喜んだのを覚えていて",
    "charAnim1": "sad3",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200200302/2002003020310"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そうだったのか\r\n初めての時から、上手くできたのか？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2002003020320,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "いえ、少し焦がしてしまった記憶があります\r\nでも、父はすごく笑顔で……",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200200302/2002003020320"
  },
  {
    "id": 2002003020330,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "ふふっ\r\n絶対に美味しくはなかったはずなんですけどね",
    "charAnim1": "smile1",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "nextLabel": "end",
    "voice": "produce_events/200200302/2002003020330"
  },
  {
    "label": "end"
  }
]